{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MegaFactory Tycoon</strong>, you are the manager of a fully automated factory.<br>The factory produces consumer products that can be sold for profit on the central market.<br><br>You decide the factory layout, place production machines and connect them with conveyor belts.<br>You also set up the logistics for trucks to transport consumer products to the central market and return with raw materials for additional production.<br>Eventually you will also be able to create blueprints for common layouts, allowing you to expand even quicker by placing an entire group of machines and belts in a single action.<br><br>As you reach certain milestones, you will unlock technologies that allow you to produce new and more advanced products, for even greater profit.<br><br>As you expand your factory, you will eventually reach its limit in size, but it does not end there.<br>You can purchase additional empty factories and fill them with machines as well.<br>Advanced quantum technology innovations let you efficiently teleport items between factories. One factory can produce intermediate products for another factory to use as input.<br><br>Every factory is fully simulated in real-time.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/dd2ff31ed7932637484451e56cab616318cabc36.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/1e80527313a76a43652a10dcc32117435b2b6c2e.jpg"},{"name":"Billionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/90e051460e81f5630d9bbe9fe93663e1d1f66537.jpg"},{"name":"Financial crisis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/b531fb22cc7a265e3b889eb465b3896fa497c9c6.jpg"},{"name":"Assembly line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/e14afa571533d3cdb6f59e62e8f474396e2a3569.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Expansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/538d1f029b1fcb4c216340ff4dcf2f31e48dd241.jpg"},{"name":"I Like to Move it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/e524f13873de8833970ca877143fd2d69adc3c49.jpg"},{"name":"We zoomin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/338f2feeed2c879f41410612755c53cd200ddb82.jpg"},{"name":"The world is my oyster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/95d546dcea162bc85a8330fe223626dd500c0464.jpg"},{"name":"Beam me up, Scotty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891760/91ec28cf6dd395183a7fce9c76c98278e16c3f3e.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891760?t=1756191061","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891760?t=1756191061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891760/782db10dc7f283a16c7d54c78ae6307cf3ed8eef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756191061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891760/782db10dc7f283a16c7d54c78ae6307cf3ed8eef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756191061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MegaFactory Tycoon</strong>, you are the manager of a fully automated factory.<br>The factory produces consumer products that can be sold for profit on the central market.<br><br>You decide the factory layout, place production machines and connect them with conveyor belts.<br>You also set up the logistics for trucks to transport consumer products to the central market and return with raw materials for additional production.<br>Eventually you will also be able to create blueprints for common layouts, allowing you to expand even quicker by placing an entire group of machines and belts in a single action.<br><br>As you reach certain milestones, you will unlock technologies that allow you to produce new and more advanced products, for even greater profit.<br><br>As you expand your factory, you will eventually reach its limit in size, but it does not end there.<br>You can purchase additional empty factories and fill them with machines as well.<br>Advanced quantum technology innovations let you efficiently teleport items between factories. One factory can produce intermediate products for another factory to use as input.<br><br>Every factory is fully simulated in real-time.</p>","developers":["Brian Strack Jensen"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891760/938e4b0e1aea568ccb34d54826491e3ff6912b18/header.jpg?t=1756191061","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891760/1476754645/cedc51cc388a6fa76664e6cd78ae238a03e5f3d6/1756189397/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756190933","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891760/1476754645/cedc51cc388a6fa76664e6cd78ae238a03e5f3d